WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.341 --> 00:00:05.215
- Hello everyone, my name is Lily

00:00:05.215 --> 00:00:07.538
and I'm here to announce
a brand new series

00:00:07.538 --> 00:00:11.018
on Evan's channel called Unlocking Lily.

00:00:11.018 --> 00:00:12.934
So I had my first sit-down with Evan

00:00:12.934 --> 00:00:15.573
about a year and a half
ago as an instructor

00:00:15.573 --> 00:00:16.974
at his dance studio.

00:00:16.974 --> 00:00:18.811
During the meeting, he told me that

00:00:18.811 --> 00:00:21.025
he really liked me and he wanted

00:00:21.025 --> 00:00:23.823
to start some sort of business with me.

00:00:23.823 --> 00:00:27.490
So my first thought
was, wow, he is so nice.

00:00:28.912 --> 00:00:32.587
And what an amazing
confidence-booster for me.

00:00:32.587 --> 00:00:36.754
Then my second thought was,
I don't have a business plan.

00:00:38.754 --> 00:00:42.699
Oh my gosh, I don't even
have a business idea.

00:00:42.699 --> 00:00:45.319
I've never thought about
becoming an entrepreneur,

00:00:45.319 --> 00:00:47.029
I don't think that's
something I'm supposed

00:00:47.029 --> 00:00:49.170
to do with my life.

00:00:49.170 --> 00:00:52.035
So that's where it kind of ended.

00:00:52.035 --> 00:00:56.798
I went on to continue to
teach at his dance studio,

00:00:56.798 --> 00:00:59.465
but that thought always remained

00:01:00.543 --> 00:01:02.543
in the back of my mind.

00:01:02.543 --> 00:01:06.124
So it was fine, things progressed on.

00:01:06.124 --> 00:01:08.422
I continued to teach at his dance school.

00:01:08.422 --> 00:01:12.771
As I got to know him better
and we had more sit-downs,

00:01:12.771 --> 00:01:17.327
I decided that maybe I'll
let him know about my dream.

00:01:17.327 --> 00:01:20.761
My dream is to go on stage one day

00:01:20.761 --> 00:01:24.178
and be a speaker, but I have no idea how.

00:01:25.902 --> 00:01:29.163
I don't know when, I don't
know what I'm going to say,

00:01:29.163 --> 00:01:32.068
I have no experience, but I knew

00:01:32.068 --> 00:01:34.822
this is something I
wanted to do with my life,

00:01:34.822 --> 00:01:36.587
but I just didn't know how to get there.

00:01:36.587 --> 00:01:40.754
So last week, he decided to
do something rather crazy.

00:01:41.672 --> 00:01:45.505
He offered me $50,000
to quit my full-time job

00:01:47.460 --> 00:01:51.627
that I had been at for 12
years to pursue my dream

00:01:52.756 --> 00:01:54.708
of public speaking full-time.

00:01:54.708 --> 00:01:56.534
As he was mentioning this to me,

00:01:56.534 --> 00:01:58.701
I already made up my mind.

00:01:59.539 --> 00:02:01.295
He doesn't know that.

00:02:01.295 --> 00:02:04.906
I already knew that I would say yes.

00:02:04.906 --> 00:02:08.472
But of course, I didn't
want to verbally commit

00:02:08.472 --> 00:02:11.389
knowing that there's so many things

00:02:12.288 --> 00:02:14.478
that could go wrong.

00:02:14.478 --> 00:02:17.701
Ever since I became an adult at 21,

00:02:17.701 --> 00:02:21.034
at 20, I always been financially secure.

00:02:23.072 --> 00:02:24.656
That's something that was very important

00:02:24.656 --> 00:02:26.786
to me growing up.

00:02:26.786 --> 00:02:28.589
For me to take this leap of faith,

00:02:28.589 --> 00:02:31.903
it means that I may not
be financially secure.

00:02:31.903 --> 00:02:35.430
I may not be able to provide a life

00:02:35.430 --> 00:02:38.919
for me and my husband that I've always

00:02:38.919 --> 00:02:40.422
promised that I will.

00:02:40.422 --> 00:02:42.952
And that was my biggest concern.

00:02:42.952 --> 00:02:45.058
I needed to talk to my husband before

00:02:45.058 --> 00:02:48.286
I actually said anything to him.

00:02:48.286 --> 00:02:50.314
But even though I knew this is something

00:02:50.314 --> 00:02:52.481
that I wanted to do.

00:02:52.481 --> 00:02:55.119
That is the only thing
I ever really wanted

00:02:55.119 --> 00:02:58.536
to do in my life more than anything else.

00:03:00.520 --> 00:03:02.712
So I spoke to my husband and he was

00:03:02.712 --> 00:03:05.854
so incredibly supportive and he knew

00:03:05.854 --> 00:03:08.283
that I needed to do this.

00:03:08.283 --> 00:03:10.366
It's really now or never.

00:03:13.997 --> 00:03:16.997
If I didn't do this now, I will live

00:03:18.155 --> 00:03:20.822
and die never pursuing my dream.

00:03:23.912 --> 00:03:27.106
So I accepted his offer at midnight

00:03:27.106 --> 00:03:29.877
that day, I sent him a message,

00:03:29.877 --> 00:03:33.036
and the next day, I told my boss

00:03:33.036 --> 00:03:36.361
that I'll be leaving my
job, that I have been

00:03:36.361 --> 00:03:39.220
with the company for 12 years.

00:03:39.220 --> 00:03:40.708
And it was really, really hard

00:03:40.708 --> 00:03:44.337
for me because I have been so happy

00:03:44.337 --> 00:03:46.842
at my job, I love the people there,

00:03:46.842 --> 00:03:49.592
I loved my boss, she's wonderful.

00:03:50.948 --> 00:03:54.037
For me to say that I'm going to be leaving

00:03:54.037 --> 00:03:57.413
this secure, wonderful job that I've been

00:03:57.413 --> 00:03:59.807
at for 12 years with all the friends

00:03:59.807 --> 00:04:03.719
I created, to tell them that I'm going to

00:04:03.719 --> 00:04:08.035
be doing this because
I'm going to be pursuing

00:04:08.035 --> 00:04:11.323
my dream of public speaking, it was

00:04:11.323 --> 00:04:12.990
crazy, crazy for me.

00:04:26.965 --> 00:04:29.465
You see, we don't have a plan.

00:04:31.043 --> 00:04:33.723
The plan is to make a plan.

00:04:33.723 --> 00:04:37.358
I'm taking a giant leap of faith with Evan

00:04:37.358 --> 00:04:39.750
and stepping into the unknown.

00:04:39.750 --> 00:04:43.339
But I know it's going to work out.

00:04:43.339 --> 00:04:45.564
And we're going to bring
you on this journey.

00:04:45.564 --> 00:04:48.115
That's why it's called Unlocking Lily.

00:04:48.115 --> 00:04:50.782
As I learn, grow, make mistakes,

00:04:51.781 --> 00:04:55.253
have wins, you're going to come with me.

00:04:55.253 --> 00:04:59.424
You're going to even sit in on
my mentoring meetings with Evan.

00:04:59.424 --> 00:05:03.734
My practice sessions, my
confessional thoughts,

00:05:03.734 --> 00:05:06.234
and watch me conquer my dream.

00:05:07.161 --> 00:05:09.782
And I hope I see me go for it.

00:05:09.782 --> 00:05:12.470
It inspires you as well.

00:05:12.470 --> 00:05:14.800
And at the very least, cheer me on

00:05:14.800 --> 00:05:16.969
because I'm going to need your support.

00:05:16.969 --> 00:05:18.911
I'm going to need a shoulder to cry on

00:05:18.911 --> 00:05:20.514
when things are tough.

00:05:20.514 --> 00:05:24.133
I'm going to need to celebrate with you

00:05:24.133 --> 00:05:26.168
when I have my victories.

00:05:26.168 --> 00:05:28.041
This is going to be a weekly series

00:05:28.041 --> 00:05:29.936
on Evan's channel where I'm going

00:05:29.936 --> 00:05:32.519
to film and I hope you tune in.

00:05:33.902 --> 00:05:35.775
And if you have any questions,

00:05:35.775 --> 00:05:38.205
suggestions, please
leave it in the comments.

00:05:38.205 --> 00:05:41.671
I promise you I'm paying attention

00:05:41.671 --> 00:05:43.927
and I will take everything to heart.

00:05:43.927 --> 00:05:47.510
So stay tuned for
Unlocking Lily Episode 1.

00:05:48.517 --> 00:05:51.218
Thank you so much Believe Nation.

00:05:51.218 --> 00:05:53.871
I am so incredibly excited and grateful

00:05:53.871 --> 00:05:57.621
and honored, and I hope
to see you very soon.

